gametitle=Grand Theft Auto III (NTSC-U) SLUS-20062 [5E115FB6]

[Cheats\First Person - Overhead Slot]
author=OpenAI
description=First-person view replaces the overhead on-foot camera. Cycle past the three normal third-person distances. Keeps native eye position and right-stick look; allows camera-relative directional movement. Optional inversion settings below require this cheat. Fully restart with this cheat disabled to uninstall.
